@*
===========================================================
ORANGE TENDER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
PAGE: Clarification Thread

DEVELOPER OWNER: ALL TEAM
MODULE: Clarifications, Notifications & Audit Trail
TRELLO TASK: Clarifications, Notifications & Audit Trail
TRELLO URL: https://trello.com/c/N1OFBdNM

PURPOSE:
Read and reply to one clarification thread, with
attachments.

BUSINESS ACCESS:
The two participants of the thread

ROUTE: /Clarifications/Details/{id?}

FUTURE IMPLEMENTATION:
- Load the thread only if the user is FromUser or ToUser.
- POST reply: ClarificationMessage (+ Documents with
  ClarificationMessageId); update Status; notify the other
  participant.

DEPENDENCIES:
Clarifications, ClarificationMessages, Documents,
Notifications.

STATUS:
UI SCAFFOLD ONLY — BUSINESS LOGIC NOT IMPLEMENTED.
===========================================================
*@
@{
    Layout = WorkspaceNavigation.LayoutFor(User);
    ViewData["Title"] = "Clarification Thread";
    ViewData["WorkspaceSection"] = "Clarifications";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Messages of one clarification thread.";
}
<partial name="_PageHeader" />
<partial name="_ScaffoldNotice" />

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Thread</h2>
    <dl class="pg-dl">
        <div><dt>Subject</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Linked to</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>From</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>To</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Opened</dt><dd>—</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Messages</h2>
    <partial name="_EmptyState" model='"No messages are loaded yet."' />
</section>

<section class="ws-panel pg-panel">
    <h2>Reply</h2>
    <form class="pg-form">
        <fieldset disabled>
            <div class="pg-form-grid">
                <div class="pg-field pg-field-wide"><label for="f-message-1">Message</label><textarea id="f-message-1" rows="4"></textarea></div>
                <div class="pg-field"><label for="f-attachment-2">Attachment</label><input id="f-attachment-2" type="file" /></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pg-actions"><button type="submit" class="pg-btn pg-btn-primary">Send reply</button><button type="button" class="pg-btn">Mark as resolved</button><span class="pg-hint">Not implemented yet — nothing is saved.</span></div>
        </fieldset>
    </form>
</section>
